@startuml
!include _style.iuml
hide empty description
top to bottom direction
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 60
state "正常" as Ready
state "刷新中" as Refreshing
state "抓取失败" as Failed
[*] --> Ready : 来源添加\n／读取成功
Ready -right-> Refreshing : 用户发起刷新
Refreshing -[norank]-> Ready : 提交成功\n／更新条目与刷新时间
Refreshing -down-> Failed : 抓取、解析或写入失败\n／回滚本源事务、记录原因
Failed -[norank]-> Refreshing : 用户手动重试
@enduml
